{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00477","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黑郊迎神 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黑郊迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄英戒序，黑郊临候。\n掌礼陈彝，司筵执豆。\n寒氛敛色，沍泉凝漏。\n乐以迎神，八音斯奏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}